  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Since the platform is depressed by an amount x, the total work done on the spring is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math>. This work is stored in the spring in the form of potential energy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>k</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>.<br /><br />Equating the two, we have<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>k</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>2&#160;</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">mg</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math><br /><br />Given, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>. Substituting these values, we get<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>.",
    "image": null
  },
